  VALUES ('CORE', 179, 'Detail-view tabs: active tab underline invisible', 'On the patient card (and every detail view using DetailViewTabs from 600px up) no tab looks selected: the user can''t tell which tab they are on. Since [CORE-135](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-135/one-apple-style-segmented-control-for-every-switcher), scoped CSS `.app-segmented-tabs__thumb { background: surface }` overrides the `bg-primary` utility (Vuetify 4 puts utilities in a cascade layer), so the underline bar is painted in the surface color and disappears.', 'AppSegmentedTabs underline variant: the thumb is explicitly primary-colored again, and the active label uses primary too so the selected tab reads at a glance. Track (calendar) variant unchanged.',
    '* Underline thumb + active label are primary in light and dark
* Unit test pins the underline thumb color rule
* Calendar segmented control looks unchanged', 'done', 0, ARRAY['Bug']::text[],
