  VALUES ('CORE', 180, 'Repo security baseline: secret scanning, push protection, CodeQL, gitleaks', 'The repo is public. Secret scanning, push protection and Dependabot alerts are all switched off, and there is no CodeQL or history scan. One leaked key in git history would be readable by anyone. A med-tech product has to be able to show a scanning baseline.', '* Scan the full git history with gitleaks. If anything leaks, rotate the key before going further.
