* Decision source: gh-pr-r1/r2 decision forms. The repo stays public and on free GitHub.',
    '* A history scan report exists with 0 open findings.
* The security workflow is green on the PR.
* The settings API shows secret scanning, push protection and Dependabot alerts enabled.', 'done', 2, '{}'::text[],
