  VALUES ('CORE', 182, 'Story coverage report: acceptance criteria mapped to e2e tests', 'docs/stories holds 68 stories with criteria and none maps each criterion to a test. Screens look done while save/refresh/other screens don''t work, so Łukasz does the QA by hand. About 19 pwa tests assert source strings instead of behavior.', 'Tests carry `@<TICKET> ACn`. `story-coverage.mjs` maps a story''s criteria to tests and **blocks from day one** (Łukasz 2026-10-07, replaces D2''s 2-week report): pre-push, CI and the ship-artifact handover refuse a gap; a UI change also needs a real-backend e2e. Skills: criteria written as user paths, /dev feat builds the whole slice tests-first (no API stub).',
    '* The script lists every story''s covered/uncovered criteria (unit-tested); CI summary shows the table.
* A ticket branch with an untested criterion fails pre-push, CI and the handover.
* The ship-artifact page shows the ticket''s criteria → tests table.
* A follow-up ticket exists for replacing the brittle source-string tests.

Decision: [https://claude.ai/artifact/7d4M9s7oxnkVjbLgz6PhVG](<https://claude.ai/artifact/7d4M9s7oxnkVjbLgz6PhVG>)', 'needs_review', 3, '{}'::text[],
